			"notes": "# What's new\n\n- **Supported full versions of Fabric Carpet (1.14.4~26.1)**\n  - `breakDripleafKeepStem` only supports 1.17+\n  - `itemsCanPassThroughChains` only supports 1.16+\n- **Refactor whole project**\n  - Now using [Preprocessor (Fallen-Breath fork)](https://github.com/Fallen-Breath/preprocessor) + Fabric Loom to build projects\n- **Removed `qcaDebugLog`, `easyHopperLimitation`, `crafterLimitation`, `beaconIncreaseInteractionRange` and `beaconIncreaseInteractionRangeValue` rules, as they are infrequently used, and hard to maintenance.**\n- **Ranamed `bonemealCanDoubleSmallFlowers` into `fertilizableSmallFlowers`**\n\n# 新更改\n\n- **支持了 Fabric Carpet 全版本（1.14.4~26.1）**\n  - `破坏大型垂滴叶保留茎` 仅支持 1.17+\n  - `物品可穿过铁链` 仅支持 1.16+\n- **重构了整个项目**\n  - 现使用 [Preprocessor (Fallen-Breath 分支)](https://github.com/Fallen-Breath/preprocessor) + Fabric Loom 构建项目\n- **移除了 `QCA Debug 日志`、`简易漏斗限类`、`合成器配方限制`、`信标可提升玩家交互范围` 和 `信标可提升玩家交互范围值` 规则，因为它们不仅极少使用，还难以维护。**\n- **将 `骨粉可复制小型花` 重命名为 `小型花施肥`**\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/QiuShui1012/Qualia-Carpet-Addition/compare/1.2.3-fabric+1.21.1...2.0.0-fabric"
